{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fbba1407-f367-89c4-8646-b29507a0482d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:30:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I think my trash got missed again. Can you hear me okay? I'm on speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's 46 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "46 Eustis Avenue. And when was the pickup that got missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, so, this morning. Well, I put it out last night. And the truck did come by, because the bin was moved, but the trash is still in it. And, I know this is silly, the bin is cracked now. The lid is hanging off on one side. Looks like the truck grabbed it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the truck came, didn't empty it, and the bin was damaged. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Sorry. And it's the second miss in a row. Last week's was skipped too. I figured I'd just wait a week, but then this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, two pickups in a row at 46 Eustis. I'm writing that down. Was the bin out by the curb, the usual spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right at the curb, lid closed, handle facing the street. Sorry, I'm home all day now so I can see it from the window. I got laid off in the fall, so I'm job hunting. Might as well be useful, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that helps us, actually. So you'd be there if someone wanted to look at the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'm here. I'll leave it where it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll put in a report for the missed pickup and a request for a replacement bin because of the damage. Do you have a number in case the office needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, sure. It's 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160. Got it. I'll send this to the sanitation supervisor today. Hopefully they'll get a truck back to you in the next day or two, and someone will sort out the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I keep the trash out at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd bring it back up beside the house if it's going to sit, and then put it out again when you hear from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. Thanks very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
